    "text": "By Avery Davis ,\n6 hours ago ALBEMARLE COUNTY, Va. (WVIR) -A boil water advisory remains in effect for northern Albemarle County after a pipe break was discovered early Tuesday morning. Rivanna Water and Sewer crews discovered the break quickly, and Albemarle County Service Authority has joined the repair effort. Traffic is expected on Route 2, north... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
